  "goodToKnow": "Absterben means to die off or wither, used for plants, cells, tissue or limbs: abgestorbene Äste, Zellen sterben ab. Fingers can feel wie abgestorben (numb). In the 1980s, the fear of Waldsterben (forest dieback from acid rain) shaped German environmental politics, and the word entered other languages. Irregular: starb ab, ist abgestorben."
